window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My fated mate betrayed me, leaving me broken and alone.</b></p> <p>As the future second-in-command of my pack, my destiny was clear—until the leader of a rival pack rejected our bond, shattering my heart and destroying my world.</p> <p>But his cruelty didn't stop there. He unleashed a brutal attack, slaughtering everyone I loved.</p> <p>Barely escaping with my sister, we were hunted, wounded, and desperate. Swept into a raging river, I thought death was inevitable—until Ryker, a dangerously sexy shifter cloaked in shadows, pulled me from the water.</p> <p>Ryker isn't my savior. He plans to leave me broken and vulnerable, but his pack intervenes, offering protection and a promise to help me find my sister. Yet Ryker's ruthless nature and untamed power terrify me as much as they captivate me.</p> <p>As secrets unravel and our connection deepens, I realize our bond could destroy us.</p> <p>To survive, I must risk everything, including my heart, and do the one thing I swore I never would—trust Ryker, even if it means confronting the darkness within us both.</p> <p>Betrayed Mate <i>is a fated mates wolf shifter romance that includes betrayal, morally gray characters, who did this to you, touch her and unalive, secret heritage, and found family tropes.</i></p>"; 
